window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>The first book in an irresistible new dark romance trilogy by Katelyn Taylor, popular author of <i>Graves </i>and the Gallows Hill<i> </i>series, this</b> <b>seductive novel is filled with romantic suspense and forbidden passion, where just one night can awaken your deepest, darkest desires</b><b>.</b><br><br>One touch. One moment. One night.<br> <br> That’s all it was meant to be.<br> <br> One crazy night in a masked sex club for my best friend’s birthday.<br> <br> I didn’t know what to expect. The last thing I saw happening was a sexy and mysterious Dom choosing me to be his Sub for the night.<br> <br> But once the mask was lifted, everything changed.<br> <br> It could never be just a casual one night stand. Mainly because the Dom I spent the night with wasn’t just anyone, he was my mother’s ex-husband…my ex-stepfather.<br> <br> And now that he’s had me, he isn’t letting go.<br> <br> From bestselling author Katelyn Taylor—creator of <i>Graves</i> and the Gallows Hill series—this seductive novel blends romantic suspense with forbidden desire, where one night of passion ignites an obsession neither of them can escape."; 
